controls: Add explicit sizing hooks

Newport sizes controls in logical pixels rather than Kit's rem-based named
sizes, so a few controls need explicit sizing seams. Behavior is unchanged.

- Button::content_style is public.
- Pagination::item_style and Pagination::content_style style every page and
  navigation button.
- Switch::track_size and Switch::label_size; the thumb follows the track.
  A disabled solid thumb is blended against the surface, so a custom light
  thumb dims in dark mode too.
- Checkbox and Tab honor Size::Size, and TabBar::label_size sets every
  tab's label size.
- Input and Textarea content_padding set the inner text inset separately
  from the frame padding.

Remove each hook when upstream offers an equivalent.

